Universal Byte-Level Encoding (UBE) for Hugging Face Tokenizers
Copyright 2026 Samsung Electronics Co., Ltd.

This repository is a modified version of Hugging Face Tokenizers
(https://github.com/huggingface/tokenizers). The repository root is based on
Tokenizers v0.23.3 and the v1/ folder on Tokenizers v1.0.0-rc.2.

